# REPLACE WITH REAL .usdz
#
# Sprint 30 Bucket JJ — placeholder for ARKit Quick Look.
#
# Real .usdz binaries are produced by the `usdz-converter` Cloud Run service
# (see infra/usdz-converter/) from the matching .glb files in this folder's
# parent directory. Apple's `usdzconvert` only runs on macOS; do NOT try to
# generate these locally on Windows/Linux.
#
# Build pipeline: scripts/generate-ar-usdz.mjs invokes the Cloud Run service
# for each kind in PlacedObjectKind and uploads the resulting .usdz to GCS.
#
# SAFETY NOTE (P1 ticket 39baa66d-73fe-8125-aca4-eeb2e33e5f8a):
# This file is INTENTIONALLY a text placeholder. The ArQuickLookButton
# component now validates USDZ magic bytes (PK\x03\x04 ZIP header) before
# rendering the "Ver en AR" affordance, so iOS will NOT open Quick Look
# on this placeholder. The button stays hidden until a real .usdz binary
# replaces this file via the Cloud Run converter. Do not change this file
# to a real USDZ binary unless you are running scripts/generate-ar-usdz.mjs.
